{"v":4,"catch":"激光戰鬥的鬥獸場！","desc":"《GROBDA》是NAMCO（現“Bandai Namco Entertainment”）於1984年發行的射擊遊戲。\n在你努力成為“BATTLING”競技場中排名第一的戰士的過程中，在競技場中擊敗你所有對手的機器。\n一次爆炸炸毀多個敵人以獲得獎勵積分！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-02-16","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69fa444de1875344b6a60bf34a6b31c50833462060c54e1d0168386d18246a8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69870da5b37b69e78d3e033f0f7b0cc654aee2786ebcdcafda0c26ee554710fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff4dfb6496ef837cc12607886c91c4bb81805a25efa54a61aac95579a0d4d36b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/17f306d31bbdbd17eb40f5ba57bf403a3ab62f2fb5075d2f464f838c87deb2f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9fb443493a6b26020d21cbc40252ba74ca1c1176356968d64d998b3787b46d92.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f41697d3f32bae10e4a7e95c8534d7060c1eda63a82f907345d18a7830367fd.jpg"],"titleId":"0100068019e16000","dlc":[]}